{"id":"ae10ea6d3d0420ac","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-beth-definability.md","title":"Beth Definability for GL","display":"thm-beth-definability — Beth Definability for GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-beth-definability","aliases":["89-thm-beth-definability"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-beth-definability — Beth Definability for GL","depends_on":["[[89-thm-craig-interpolation]]","[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-beth-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-beth-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-beth-definability — Beth Definability for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40d41bb5aac76af5\" href=\"?note=40d41bb5aac76af5\" title=\"89-thm-craig-interpolation\">89-thm-craig-interpolation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fae50ce87c0c5e77\" href=\"?note=fae50ce87c0c5e77\" title=\"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl\">89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\ne p\">\\(q\\ne p\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\">\\(q\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D&#39;=D[p:=q]\">\\(D&#39;=D[p:=q]\\)</span> 为统一结构替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n(D\\land D&#39;\\to(p\\leftrightarrow q))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land(D\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n(D\\land D&#39;\\to(p\\leftrightarrow q))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land(D\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 121–122；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>前提命题等价地推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\land p\\to(D&#39;\\to q)\">\\(D\\land p\\to(D&#39;\\to q)\\)</span>。Craig 插值给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\land p\\to H\">\\(D\\land p\\to H\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\to(D&#39;\\to q)\">\\(H\\to(D&#39;\\to q)\\)</span>；两端共同字母均来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 且不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，也不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>。第一条给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\to(p\\to H)\">\\(D\\to(p\\to H)\\)</span>。第二条给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D&#39;\\to(H\\to q)\">\\(D&#39;\\to(H\\to q)\\)</span>，在其定理中替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:=p\">\\(q:=p\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D&#39;\">\\(D&#39;\\)</span> 变回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 不变，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\to(H\\to p)\">\\(D\\to(H\\to p)\\)</span>。命题合取两方向得结论。\n这里明确要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 不在原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 中；若只写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\ne p\">\\(q\\ne p\\)</span>，替换回代未必恢复原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，且字母界推理会失效。它是条件下的显式定义，不是无前提的全局等价 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leftrightarrow H\">\\(p\\leftrightarrow H\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-craig-interpolation","status":"resolved","id":"40d41bb5aac76af5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-craig-interpolation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl","status":"resolved","id":"fae50ce87c0c5e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\ne p","display":false},{"tex":"q\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"D'=D[p:=q]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n(D\\land D'\\to(p\\leftrightarrow q))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land(D\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"D\\land p\\to(D'\\to q)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\land p\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"H\\to(D'\\to q)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"D\\to(p\\to H)","display":false},{"tex":"D'\\to(H\\to q)","display":false},{"tex":"q:=p","display":false},{"tex":"D'","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"D\\to(H\\to p)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"q\\ne p","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leftrightarrow H","display":false}],"bytes":1585,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c6cad39792d5f33","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"第三种存在证明：[[89-df-inseparable-pair]] → [[89-lem-inseparable-extension]] → [[89-lem-inseparable-box-witness]] → [[89-thm-craig-interpolation]] → [[89-thm-beth-definability]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-beth]]。"}],"outgoing":["40d41bb5aac76af5","fae50ce87c0c5e77","71b4f56d6213ff7c"]}